Subject: [PATCH] Compose MRT, framebuffer fetch and depth attachments consistently

Keep render-pass and framebuffer attachment counts aligned on resident and pooled
paths. Enable independentBlend only when supported, reject incompatible per-target
states otherwise, and release dedicated MRT memory at pool teardown.

Regression: an isolated fetch+MRT draw reproduced Boot115's SIGSEGV at the same
lavapipe instruction (ELF offset 0x7c4c8). The 24-case matrix verifies primary and
secondary pixel content; Vulkan validation is clean for the targeted MRT suite.

